      "writtenOn": "2023-06-23T19:06:52Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e Putting ConsumeAll in the task runner thread would actually result in the same deadlock as before.\n\nSorry, I should have stated that if ConsumeAll is only called from within the TaskRunner, it wouldn\u0027t need to be protected by any lock (I am assuming that task runner is essentially an event loop?).",
      "parentUuid": "e9f410a5_ebcbdb30",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 39,
        "startChar": 4,
        "endLine": 39,
        "endChar": 20
      },
      "revId": "f5326be5dd04d964becb8f8713a57e14619f8425",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
